	(text "Rev 2: VBATT is the cell alone, VSYS runs the board, so the charger's whole 41mA reaches the cell in" (at 141.04 292.5 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "46b6b7a4-df1a-5cd1-a071-3836264c9b91"))
	(text "either switch position. Q2's SOURCE is VSYS and its drain VBATT — a P-FET body diode conducts" (at 141.04 295.16 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "8f93870c-9a6c-583f-8538-51159acdc0d8"))
	(text "drain->source, so that way round it blocks USB from back-feeding the cell past the charger." (at 141.04 297.82 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "f4a0dce1-232d-59c9-b1c6-fb666ab52519"))
